  <constraints>
    <constraint source="spec / FR-12">Scope: residual-mammoth removal ONLY after the Phase 0 gate (006) is green AND no projection-less mount remains. MUST NOT delete mammoth while any projection-less mount still needs it — that is a BLOCKED condition, escalate.</constraint>
