    <constraint source="project / I-5,I-7">After cutover exactly ONE byte-author remains (the `ComposeShadowPatchEngine`); zero text-search anchoring survives in the write path. Grep MUST show no `LocateTarget` / text-search call site.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project / §10 BFF hygiene">State the Placement Justification in the PR (deletion consolidates onto `Services/Compose/`; no new surface). Report BFF publish size absolute + delta vs ~49.63 MB baseline (incl. PDBs), ≤60 MB — a deletion should not increase it. Verify no new HIGH CVE.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-038 / NFR-06">Do NOT delete or weaken the corpus/seam evidence; the post-cutover corpus proof (task 034/061) must still pass. No `Mock&lt;HttpMessageHandler&gt;`, DI-registration, or ctor-null tests introduced.</constraint>
