  <steps mode="prescriptive">
    <step order="0" name="Context + rigor declaration + gate check">Output the FULL rigor-level declaration (rigor FULL, reason: irreversible deletion + bff-api/frontend/deletion tags). Load knowledge files + `bff-extensions.md`. VERIFY task 006 (Phase 0 gate) is GREEN and task 032 is DONE — if either is not, STOP, remain blocked, escalate per root §6/§6.5. State the Placement Justification for the PR.</step>
    <step order="1" name="Confirm no projection-less mount remains">Audit every Compose editor mount (`ComposeEditor.tsx` and any other mount site) to confirm the projection builder is the only mapper and NO mount depends on the mammoth fallback. If ANY projection-less mount still exists, mammoth removal is BLOCKED — surface per root §6 and stop.</step>
    <step order="2" name="Remove residual mammoth">Delete `docxToTipTapHtml` from `docxBridge.ts` and the mammoth fallback branch from `ComposeEditor.tsx`; remove the `mammoth` dependency from the shared-lib package manifest.</step>
    <step order="3" name="Grep-audit — prove the legacy surface is gone">Run repo-wide grep for `mammoth`, `collectEditedParagraphs`, `DocxAnnotationWriter`, `ComposeParagraphRedlineSynthesizer`, and `LocateTarget`. Every one MUST return ZERO references. If any survives, resolve it (it belongs to the RIP list) before proceeding.</step>
    <step order="4" name="Confirm one engine + build">Confirm exactly ONE byte-author remains — `ComposeShadowPatchEngine`. Build the shared lib with `npm run build:prod` (NOT `npm run build`) and build the BFF (`dotnet build src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/`). Both green.</step>
    <step order="5" name="Publish-size + CVE report">Run `dotnet publish -c Release src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/ -o deploy/api-publish/`; report compressed size absolute + delta vs ~49.63 MB baseline (incl. PDBs), ≤60 MB. Run `dotnet list package --vulnerable --include-transitive` — no new HIGH CVE.</step>
    <step order="6" name="conflict-check + finalize">Run `/conflict-check` before the PR. Update `projects/spaarkeai-compose-r4/tasks/TASK-INDEX.md`: set this task's status to ✅. Document any deviation in `projects/spaarkeai-compose-r4/notes/`.</step>
  </steps>

